# Clone copies Ornithopter (mana value 0) before being sacrificed; Metamorphosis uses that last-known value, not Clone's mana value 4 in the graveyard (CR 608.2h).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Clone
Metamorphosis
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clone.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Metamorphosis.Cast
! Bot1.Choose(Mox Emerald)
Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Colors(Blue)
[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {U} (CreatureSpells)
Bot1.Graveyard = Metamorphosis; Clone; Black Lotus
